A||||5||FieroKyle||Nice Ricer and his Girlfriend when I have car trouble!||||1||
Z||000000||FieroKyle||08-27-2001||01:28 AM||||Wow, I met a nice guy today and his girlfriend. Here is the story.... I am going for a ride in our MG Midget. Well its been having battery trouble lately. So I drive through town and then I go south of town and see a Bricklin for sale. I am like whoa! never seen a Bricklin before so I stop and look at it. Some one in De Lorean post said Bricklins had the engines in the rear.... I DON'T THINK SO! I looked under the car and everything. So I go back to the car and the battery is dead. I am like OH SH#T!!!. Well I push it and luckily this parking lot had enough slope where I could run with the car, jump in it and pull start it. So I am like, thats a close one! So then I head home and when I am pulling into my driveway, I shift into 4th accident instead of 2nd and stall the car. My driveway is flat. Plus I live way out in the country. So I am pushing my car as fast as I can and trying to jump in it to push start it again. Well, I can't get it going fast enough.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. Well after 20 minutes of that, a guy and his girlfriend in his Toyota Celica with the big ass wing get out and ask for help. I say alright, sure. So we push the car and still couldn't go fast enough. Well on the second try I was able to start it up. I thank them and they leave. I was like, man they were so polite. So that sorta made my day today.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
