Z||000004||grinthock||08-27-2001||09:41 AM||||Honestly everyone I have been helped by alot of ricers before.  SOME of them are bad, but there is a RASH generalization about ricers that you guys gotta stop having.  <P>When I talk about ricers I do'nt talk about the person, I talk about the car RICE implies a SPECIFIC style of car being stickers, coffee can exhaust and the like<P>BUT To talk about the people that drive those cars like that is wrong, because you do'nt know them, I know alot of ricers who are really great people, THEY have their style, WE have ours...   Don't drive around thinking they are all jerks, that's just BS  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">||||reg||13
